# only with Manafont (47), Chainspell (48), Astral Flow (55) or Azure Lore (163) on the char; without one, 13. Accepted at
# Prog 1 (GMs), a level 99 Warrior (no mage job), the other logs' missions as the group's drafts set them (none answers
# Erlene). Erlene: 13. effect 47: Manafont. Erlene: 14, finished: the Grimoire and the Scholar job gesture, Schultz
# Scholar, completed, Scholar unlocked (YOU_CAN_NOW_BECOME_A_SCHOLAR).
lists TheEldiemeNecropolisS/Erlene/onTrigger TheEldiemeNecropolisS/onEventFinish/14
char zone=TheEldiemeNecropolisS pos=378.436,-39.999,17.914 job=WAR lvl=99
